    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "A steady week. The team completed 48 jobs between Monday and Saturday, against a 4-week average of 47.00, and revenue came in at $23,850.00, 2.8% above the average of $23,210.00. Plumbing was the busiest line with 19 jobs and $10,180.00. HVAC did 16 jobs for $7,945.00, and Electrical did 13 jobs for $5,725.00.\n\nQuality held. There were 3 callbacks, one per service line, in line with the average of 3.00. The first-time fix rate was 85.4%, a little under the 4-week average of 87.8%. The average customer rating was 4.4 from 45 rated jobs.\n\nWorth a look: 7 jobs were not fixed on the first visit, and 6 of them sit with three technicians. Marco D. fixed 4 of 6 first time, Sam P. fixed 5 of 7 first time and Luis K. fixed 6 of 8 first time. Ratings are missing on 3 jobs, so it is worth checking that the rating request went out after those visits."
    },
